{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765484,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"Valorant","festival_id":520986,"organization_id":825345,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-15T00:46:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/valorant-scaler-school-of-technology-bengaluru-karnataka-1765484","region":"hybrid","details":"<p><strong>Overview:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A competitive 5v5 Valorant tournament featuring online qualifiers leading to offline LAN finals. Teams showcase skill, teamwork, and strategy across multiple phases.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>Tournament Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Team Size:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> 5 players mandatory<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Expected Teams: <\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">~64<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Platform:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> PC &ndash; Riot official servers (Mumbai)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Event Type:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Online Qualifiers &rarr; Offline LAN Finals<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Phase 1 &ndash; Online Qualifiers:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;(Round1, 64 teams)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Format: Best of 1 (Bo1)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goal: Top 32 teams advance to Round2<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Up to 3 simultaneous\/parallel matches<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;(Round2, 32 teams)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Format: Best of 1 (Bo1)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goal: Top 16 teams advance to Round3<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Up to 3 simultaneous\/parallel matches<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;(Round3, 16 teams)<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Format: Best of 1 (Bo1)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Goal: Top 8 teams advance to Phase 2<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Up to 3 simultaneous\/parallel matches<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Phase 2 &ndash; Swiss Stage (Top 8, Online):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Format: Best of 3 (Bo3), VCT-style Swiss<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams eliminated after 2 losses, advance after 2 wins<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Seeding for Playoffs: Based on Swiss record, head-to-head, map differential, then round differential<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Phase 3 &ndash; Offline LAN Playoffs (Top 4):<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semifinals: Bo3 (Seed 1 vs 4, 2 vs 3)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">3rd Place Match: Bo3<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Grand Final: Bo5<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Semi finals at Day 1 and Finals at Day 2<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Composition &amp; Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Minimum: 5 active players<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Maximum: 5 players<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Roster Lock: 24 hrs before Phase 2<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Substitutions allowed only for emergencies with admin approval<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Players must be current Yugaantar students (valid college ID)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Prohibited: Smurfing, account sharing, unapproved software<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Map Pool &amp; Veto System:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Default Maps: Bind, Haven, Ascent, Lotus, Sunset, Corrode, Abyss, Icebox,Split, Breeze<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Veto: VCT-style adapted for Bo1, Bo3, Bo5<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Coin toss determines Team A\/B for bans and picks<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams choose starting sides after picks<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Game Setup &amp; Rules:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mode: Standard Competitive (5v5)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Admin-created lobbies for online\/offline phases<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Timeout: 1 per half, 1 additional per 2 overtime rounds<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Warmups: 5 min offline (Phase 3), online at admin discretion<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Voice: Teams must use designated Discord channel during matches<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Conduct &amp; Integrity:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Arrive 15 min prior; 10 min grace for forfeit<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cheating, hacks, collusion, match-fixing, toxic behavior = disqualification<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Admin decisions are final<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Technical &amp; Connectivity Issues:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams responsible for stable internet<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tactical pause for 1 disconnected player: max 5 min<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Multiple disconnects: Admin may pause up to 20 min<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Technical pauses: max 5 min per verified issue<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Stream outages: Match continues; admin may review VODs<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Rematch Policy:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rare; only for verified severe server issues<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Admin decides if scores\/map orders reset<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Forfeits &amp; Disqualification:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">No-shows or repeated absences = disqualification<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cheats, smurfing, disrespect, exploit of bugs = disqualification<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Judging &amp; Advancement:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams progress via match outcomes<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Phase 3 winner determined in Bo5 Grand Final<\/span><\/li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Organizers&rsquo; decision final and binding<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong style=\"color: #000000;\">Streaming &amp; Media:<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><spa